  description="7 warning signs your septic tank needs repair in Houston. Slow drains, sewage smells, gurgling pipes, and more. Know when to call for help."
  canonicalPath="/blog/signs-septic-tank-needs-repair/"
>
  <SchemaHead type="BlogPosting" blogTitle="Signs Your Septic Tank Needs Repair" blogDate="2025-07-26" />
